{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "Hands off!", "translation": "Ręce precz!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Kromede_04_cv_text", "source": "Not so fast!", "translation": "Nie tak szybko!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Sigebert_01_cv_text", "source": "True fate will soon be upon us.", "translation": "Prawdziwe przeznaczenie wkrótce nas dopadnie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Sigebert_02_cv_text", "source": "AION is naught but an illusion.", "translation": "AION jest jedynie iluzją.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Sigebert_03_cv_text", "source": "Dragon Lord Fafnir will bring us a new world!", "translation": "Smoczy Władca Fafnir stworzy dla nas nowy świat!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Sigebert_04_cv_text", "source": "No!", "translation": "Nie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2341_Daeva_01_cv_text", "source": "Kromede is trapped in the Fire Temple again? How could this happen...?!", "translation": "Kromede znów utknęła w Świątyni Ognia? Jak do tego doszło...?!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2341_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "I'm...trapped... free me...", "translation": "Jestem... uwięziona... uwolnijcie mnie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2341_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Are these the only two Kromede could convince to follow her?", "translation": "Tylko tych dwoje Kromede zdołała namówić, by za nią poszli?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2350_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Robstin... I miss you more every day...", "translation": "Robstin... z każdym dniem tęsknię za tobą coraz bardziej...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2350_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "I will have you again!", "translation": "Jeszcze cię odzyskam!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2350_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "Think you can handle me?", "translation": "Myślisz, że dasz mi radę?", "status": "draft"}
