{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2360_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Let's get somewhere safe first, High Priest.", "translation": "Najpierw znajdźmy bezpieczne miejsce, Najwyższy Kapłanie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2360_Valdemar_01_cv_text", "source": "Sigebert!", "translation": "Sigebert!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2360_Valdemar_02_cv_text", "source": "Who are you?", "translation": "Kim jesteś?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2370_Daeva01_01_cv_text", "source": "... Marchutan... my Lord...", "translation": "...Marchutanie... mój Władco...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2370_Daeva02_01_cv_text", "source": "Marchutan... Please...", "translation": "Marchutanie... proszę...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2370_Hebera_01_cv_text", "source": "Daeva.", "translation": "Daevie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2370_Hebera_02_cv_text", "source": "Horrid.", "translation": "Ohyda.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2370_Hebera_03_cv_text", "source": "You would look much better inside some Fafnite.", "translation": "W Fafnicie będzie ci znacznie lepiej.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Daeva01_01_cv_text", "source": "Marchutan... forgive me...", "translation": "Marchutanie... wybacz mi...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Daeva02_01_cv_text", "source": "Please forgive...", "translation": "Proszę, wybacz...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Hebera_01_cv_text", "source": "There is no use in resisting...", "translation": "Opór na nic się nie zda...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Hebera_02_cv_text", "source": "Whether you are god, or Daeva...", "translation": "Czy jesteś bogiem, czy należysz do rasy Daeva...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Hebera_03_cv_text", "source": "You...", "translation": "Ty...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2371_Hebera_04_cv_text", "source": "Didn't I get rid of you?", "translation": "Czyż nie pozbyłem się ciebie?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Where is Lord Marchutan?", "translation": "Gdzie jest Władca Marchutan?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Sigebert_01_cv_text", "source": "You're not so bad for the scraps of AION.", "translation": "Jak na resztki AION nieźle sobie radzisz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Sigebert_02_cv_text", "source": "There are no Lords.", "translation": "Nie ma już Władców.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Sigebert_03_cv_text", "source": "That shell of a god will decorate Fafnir's halls!", "translation": "Ta boska skorupa będzie ozdobą sal Fafnira!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Sigebert_04_cv_text", "source": "This Artifact, I offer up, that I may rise ever higher.", "translation": "Składam ten Artefakt w ofierze, by wznieść się jeszcze wyżej.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2372_Sigebert_05_cv_text", "source": "Great Fafnir is our destiny!", "translation": "Wielki Fafnir jest naszym przeznaczeniem!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Asar_01_cv_text", "source": "My Fragment, a new path has opened. Come to me.", "translation": "Mój Odłamku, otworzyła się nowa droga. Przybądź do mnie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Stop him!", "translation": "Powstrzymajcie go!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_01_cv_text", "source": "You... idiotic worms...", "translation": "Wy... głupie robaki...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_02_cv_text", "source": "Ugh... Gah...", "translation": "Ugh... Gah...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_03_cv_text", "source": "Lord, Fafnir, this Artifact's power I...", "translation": "Władco, Fafnirze, mocą tego Artefaktu ja...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_04_cv_text", "source": "We have been abandoned by fate.", "translation": "Los nas opuścił.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_05_cv_text", "source": "The age of the Daeva is over.", "translation": "Era Daevów dobiegła końca.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_06_cv_text", "source": "Marchutan is but a shell now, so Fafnir's new world was the only alternative we had.", "translation": "Marchutan jest teraz tylko skorupą, więc nowy świat Fafnira był jedyną alternatywą.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2373_Sigebert_07_cv_text", "source": "But now... am I returning... to AION...?", "translation": "Ale teraz... czy wracam... do AION...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2380_Fafnir_01_cv_text", "source": "Capture and bind those Daeva souls!", "translation": "Schwytajcie i zwiążcie dusze Daevów!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2380_Markutan_01_cv_text", "source": "Face your judgment... The judgement of fate...", "translation": "Stań przed sądem... przed sądem przeznaczenia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2380_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Lord Marchutan!", "translation": "Władco Marchutan!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2380_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "I need the Core of Fate. Please, come to your senses!", "translation": "Potrzebuję Rdzenia Losu. Proszę, opamiętaj się!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_01_cv_text", "source": "Have I... been freed from Fafnir's control?", "translation": "Czy... uwolniłem się spod kontroli Fafnira?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_02_cv_text", "source": "You say he is dead?", "translation": "Mówisz, że nie żyje?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_03_cv_text", "source": "I am the Empyrean Lord of fate...", "translation": "Jestem Władcą Empirian Losu...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_04_cv_text", "source": "But it seems that fate has gotten the best of me now.", "translation": "Wygląda jednak na to, że tym razem los wziął górę nade mną.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_05_cv_text", "source": "You, who reaches for the future.", "translation": "Sięgasz ku przyszłości.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_06_cv_text", "source": "You think you can master the Core of Fate?", "translation": "Czy sądzisz, że zdołasz okiełznać Rdzeń Losu?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_07_cv_text", "source": "You, too, have a bleak fate.", "translation": "Ciebie również czeka ponure przeznaczenie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_08_cv_text", "source": "I hope that fate does not catch up to you.", "translation": "Oby los cię nie dopadł.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Markutan_09_cv_text", "source": "It is time.", "translation": "Nadeszła pora.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Not yet he isnt.", "translation": "Jeszcze nie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Fafnir will be awakening very soon.", "translation": "Fafnir wkrótce się przebudzi.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "The Core of Fate, for Asmodae...", "translation": "Rdzeń Losu dla Asmodae...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "We need its power.", "translation": "Potrzebujemy jego mocy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2381_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Past the Bulwark is Pandemonium, our next stop.", "translation": "Za Wałem Obronnym leży Pandemonium, nasz kolejny przystanek.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2390_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Looks like the Dragon Lords are waking up...", "translation": "Wygląda na to, że Smoczy Władcy się budzą...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2390_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "I have to go back... now...", "translation": "Muszę wracać... natychmiast...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2390_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "To Pandemonium!", "translation": "Do Pandemonium!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9001_Bakarma_01_cv_text", "source": "From the start, the Balaur sought to surpass AION.", "translation": "Od samego początku Balaurzy dążyli do przewyższenia AION.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9001_Bakarma_02_cv_text", "source": "I am a being that never was.", "translation": "Jestem istotą, która nigdy nie istniała.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9001_Bakarma_03_cv_text", "source": "I will transcend all limits to redeem my race.", "translation": "Przekroczę wszelkie granice, by odkupić moją rasę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9002_Cromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Robstin, I am engulfed in flames of desire.", "translation": "Robstin, płonę z żądzy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9002_Cromede_02_cv_text", "source": "I need you.", "translation": "Potrzebuję cię.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9002_Cromede_03_cv_text", "source": "Is it possible to quench these flames?", "translation": "Czy da się ugasić te płomienie?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9010_Bargot_01_cv_text", "source": "Daeva...", "translation": "Daevie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9010_Bargot_02_cv_text", "source": "Die!", "translation": "Giń!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9011_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Robstin? Are you finally here?", "translation": "Robstin? Wreszcie jesteś?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9011_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "Wherever have you been?", "translation": "Gdzie cię nosiło?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S9011_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "I said I'd wait.", "translation": "Mówiłam, że będę czekać.", "status": "draft"}
